OL,3,ATrump takes aim at Republicans but says
OL,4,ADemocrats did a 'good job'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has taken aim
OL,7,Fat Republicans and conceded that the
OL,8,FDemocrats have done "a good job" in the
OL,9,FUS midterm elections, as they take
OL,10,Fcontrol of both the Senate and House of
OL,11,FRepresentatives in a momentous win.
OL,13,FIn a post on his Truth Social platform,
OL,14,FTrump derided Greg Abbott, who lost the
OL,15,FTexas governor race to Democrat Gina
OL,16,FHinojosa, saying Abbott wouldn't have
OL,17,Flost if he "hadn't become a RINO in the
OL,18,Flast six months", using the acronym for
OL,19,F"Republican in Name Only".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
