OL,3,ALeft-wing Democrat Abdul El-Sayed wins
OL,4,Ain Michigan to become first Muslim
OL,5,Asenator
OL,6,
OL,7,FLeft-wing Democrat Abdul El-Sayed has
OL,8,Fwon in the battleground state of
OL,9,FMichigan to become the US's first
OL,10,FMuslim senator, following a race
OL,11,Ffuelled by withering attacks and
OL,12,Finter-party disputes.
OL,14,FEl-Sayed bested Republican Mike Rogers,
OL,15,Fwithstanding an onslaught of attacks
OL,16,Fthat included baselessly tying him to
OL,17,Fterrorism and a high-profile spat with
OL,18,Fa fellow Democrat.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
