OL,3,AJames Talarico becomes first Democrat
OL,4,Ato win Texas Senate seat since 1988
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemocrat James Talarico has won the
OL,7,FSenate race in Texas, facing off more
OL,8,Fthan $200m in opposition spending and
OL,9,Fcreating one of the biggest upsets for
OL,10,FRepublicans in the midterms.
OL,12,FTalarico's stunning victory over
OL,13,FRepublican Ken Paxton marks the first
OL,14,Ftime a Democrat has won a US Senate
OL,15,Fseat in Texas since 1988 - and helped
OL,16,Fsolidify Democrats taking control of
OL,17,Fthe US Congress in a wave of wins
OL,18,Facross America.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
